### Base URL Variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Get all products (Default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 3. Get all products with search query parameter (Search by name: "headset")
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=headset

### 4. Get all products with sort query parameter (Sort by price ascending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sort=price_asc

### 5. Get all products with sort query parameter (Sort by price descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sort=price_desc

### 6. Get single product by valid ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 7. Get single product by invalid ID (Expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/non-existing-id

### 8. Add a new product (Valid data, expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Gaming Keyboard",
  "price": 89.99,
  "quantity": 4
}

### 9. Add a new product with invalid data (Missing price, expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Product"
}

### 10. Update an existing product (Valid data, expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "price": 69.99,
  "quantity": 12
}

### 11. Update a non-existing product (Expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Product",
  "price": 10.00,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 12. Delete an existing product (Expect 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/2

### 13. Delete non-existing product (Expect 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/99999

### 14. Access undefined route (Expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown-route
